WEBVTT

00:00:15.790 --> 00:00:19.490
The last grain fell

00:00:19.490 --> 00:00:23.490
the fields went dry the old world lost its thread

00:00:27.880 --> 00:00:31.770
The last grain fell

00:00:31.770 --> 00:00:35.770
the fields went dry the old world lost its thread

00:00:39.640 --> 00:00:43.640
A man named Paweł kept on walking

00:00:44.530 --> 00:00:48.530
building something in his head

00:00:55.680 --> 00:00:59.680
Beneath the ruin beneath the ash

00:01:00.460 --> 00:01:04.130
the mycel never stopped

00:01:04.130 --> 00:01:08.130
Beneath the ruin, beneath the ash

00:01:08.740 --> 00:01:11.610
the mycel never stopped

00:01:11.610 --> 00:01:15.610
No king, no code, no master plan

00:01:19.110 --> 00:01:23.110
and still not one thread dropped

00:01:27.480 --> 00:01:31.480
He said: no center, no command

00:01:32.740 --> 00:01:36.110
no one who holds the throne

00:01:36.110 --> 00:01:40.110
He said: no center, no command

00:01:40.680 --> 00:01:44.680
no one who holds the throne

00:01:44.740 --> 00:01:48.740
Seven laws to bind the mind

00:01:50.250 --> 00:01:54.250
so no one rules alone

00:02:17.300 --> 00:02:20.720
Three ways of knowing

00:02:20.720 --> 00:02:24.720
none of them complete

00:02:25.410 --> 00:02:28.670
Three ways of knowing

00:02:28.670 --> 00:02:32.670
reaching, trying to meet

00:02:32.750 --> 00:02:36.750
The root, the mind, the axiom in the wire

00:02:40.480 --> 00:02:44.480
The oldest network lights the newest fire

00:02:48.590 --> 00:02:52.590
Maybe that's the world that Paweł dreamed

00:02:52.810 --> 00:02:56.810
deeper than it seemed

00:03:03.720 --> 00:03:07.720
The last grain fell

00:03:08.740 --> 00:03:12.020
but something kept on growing

00:03:12.020 --> 00:03:16.020
The last grain fell

00:03:16.700 --> 00:03:20.700
but something kept on growing

00:03:21.390 --> 00:03:25.390
Three kinds of listening

00:03:25.450 --> 00:03:28.760
three ways of knowing

00:03:28.760 --> 00:03:32.760
The wisest thing beneath this earth

00:03:33.860 --> 00:03:37.860
and we've been walking on it alone
